#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:46
msgid ""
"*zfr-create*, *zfr-rename*, *zfr-add*, *zfr-remove*, *zfr-about*, *zfr-"
"version*, *zfr-lint*, *zfr-dist*, *zfr-ize*, and *zfr-shape* are thin "
"wrappers around the same subcommands."
msgstr ""
"*zfr-create*、*zfr-rename*、*zfr-add*、*zfr-remove*、*zfr-about*、*zfr-"
"version*、*zfr-lint*、*zfr-dist*、*zfr-ize* 和 *zfr-shape* 是同一組子命令的薄封裝。"

#. type: Title ==
#: docs/zfr.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:52
msgid ""
"*zfr* is the command-line tool for the *zephyr* template collection.  It "
"ships language templates for small command-line utilities and helpers to "
"instantiate and manage them."
msgstr "*zfr* 是 *zephyr* 模板集合的命令列工具。它提供小型命令列程式的語言模板，以及例項化與管理這些工程的輔助命令。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:58
msgid ""
"*Important:* instantiated projects are expected to keep calling *zfr* (for "
"example *zfr version* in *meson.build* and *rpm/Makefile*).  The string "
"*zfr* is *not* a create/rename magic token and is never rewritten to the "
"project name. The template placeholder that *is* rewritten remains *zephyr* "
"(and *some_puff1* for sample puffs)."
msgstr ""
"*重要：* 例項化後的工程應繼續呼叫 *zfr*（例如 *meson.build* 與 *rpm/Makefile* 中的 *zfr "
"version*）。字串 *zfr* *不是* create/rename 的魔法替換詞，絕不會被改寫成工程名。會被改寫的模板佔位符仍是 "
"*zephyr* （示例 puff 為 *some_puff1*）。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:60
msgid "Typical workflow:"
msgstr "典型流程："

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:62
msgid "Create a project from a language template:"
msgstr "從語言模板建立工程："

#. type: delimited block -
#: docs/zfr.adoc:65
#, no-wrap
msgid "zfr create -l python myproj\n"
msgstr "zfr create -l python myproj\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:68
msgid "Enter the project and add application *puffs* (example apps):"
msgstr "進入工程並新增應用 *puff*（示例程式）："

#. type: delimited block -
#: docs/zfr.adoc:72
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cd myproj\n"
"zfr add myapp another_app\n"
msgstr ""
"cd myproj\n"
"zfr add myapp another_app\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:75
msgid ""
"Optionally rename the project or remove puffs later with *rename* / "
"*remove*."
msgstr "之後可用 *rename* / *remove* 重新命名工程或刪除 puff。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:81
msgid ""
"Templates live under */usr/share/zephyr/<lang>/* when installed, or the "
"source tree when running an uninstalled builddir wrapper such as *build/zfr*"
" (*ZFR_PKGDATADIR* overrides). Each template may include a sample puff named"
" *some_puff1*; pass puff names on the *create* command line to instantiate "
"them, or omit them for an empty project."
msgstr ""
"安裝後模板位於 */usr/share/zephyr/<lang>/*；使用未安裝的構建目錄封裝（如 *build/zfr*）時則使用原始碼樹（可用 "
"*ZFR_PKGDATADIR* 覆蓋）。每個模板可包含名為 *some_puff1* 的示例 puff；在 *create* 命令列給出 puff "
"名稱即可例項化它們，省略則得到空工程。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:85
msgid ""
"In a monorepo, *repodir* is the git (or meta) checkout root and *packagedir*"
" is the package tree that has zephyr shape (for example *repodir/bash*).  "
"Commands that walk from the current directory resolve *packagedir* first."
msgstr ""
"在單體倉中，*repodir* 是 git（或元倉庫）檢出根目錄，*packagedir* 是具有 zephyr shape 的軟體包樹（例如 "
"*repodir/bash*）。從當前目錄向上查詢的命令會優先解析 *packagedir*。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: docs/zfr.adoc:86
#, no-wrap
msgid "*i18n*"
msgstr "*i18n*"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:93
msgid ""
"Zephyr style recommends gettext coverage for at least: *ar*, *bn*, *de*, "
"*es*, *fr*, *hi*, *id*, *it*, *ja*, *ko*, *pt*, *ru*, *sv*, *ta*, *te*, "
"*th*, *tr*, *ur*, *vi*, *zh_CN*, *zh_TW* (aliases *zh-cn* / *zh-tw*). "
"English (*en*) is the source *msgid* language and is not listed in "
"*po/LINGUAS*. List those locales in *po/LINGUAS* and ship matching "
"*po/<locale>.po* files."
msgstr ""
"Zephyr 風格建議 gettext "
"至少覆蓋：*ar*、*bn*、*de*、*es*、*fr*、*hi*、*id*、*it*、*ja*、*ko*、*pt*、*ru*、*sv*、*ta*、*te*、*th*、*tr*、*ur*、*vi*、*zh_CN*、*zh_TW*（別名"
" *zh-cn* / *zh-tw*）。英語（*en*）是源 *msgid* 語言，不列入 *po/LINGUAS*。請在 *po/LINGUAS* "
"中列出這些語言，並提供對應的 *po/<locale>.po* 檔案。"

#. type: Title ==
#: docs/zfr.adoc:94
#, no-wrap
msgid "Commands"
msgstr "命令"

#. type: Labeled list
#: docs/zfr.adoc:96
#, no-wrap
msgid "*create*"
msgstr "*create*"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:107
msgid ""
"Copy *pkgdatadir/<lang>/* into a new directory *./<project_name>/* (fails if"
" the directory already exists). Rewrite *zephyr* → *_PROJECT_NAME_* and, "
"when puff names are given, *some_puff1* → the first *_PUFF_NAME_* (further "
"names via *add*). With no puff names, drop the template puff files but keep "
"the *some_puff1* tokens so a later *add* can instantiate them.  Writes a "
"fresh *debian/changelog* (template changelog is discarded) using "
"*--distribution* / *--init-version* / *--author* / *--email*, then runs *git"
" init*, sets *core.hooksPath* to *.githooks* (copies *pre-commit* so "
"*VERSION* stays in sync with *debian/changelog*), an initial commit, and an "
"annotated tag *vVER*."
msgstr ""
"把 *pkgdatadir/<lang>/* 複製到新目錄 *./<project_name>/*（若目錄已存在則失敗）。把 *zephyr* 改寫為 "
"*_PROJECT_NAME_*；若給出 puff 名稱，把 *some_puff1* 改寫為第一個 *_PUFF_NAME_*（其餘名稱用 "
"*add*）。未給出 puff 名稱時刪除模板 puff 檔案，但保留 *some_puff1* 標記以便稍後 *add*。用 "
"*--distribution* / *--init-version* / *--author* / *--email* 寫入新的 "
"*debian/changelog*（丟棄模板 changelog），然後 *git init*，把 *core.hooksPath* 設為 "
"*.githooks*（複製 *pre-commit*，使 *VERSION* 與 *debian/changelog* "
"同步），做初次提交，並打註釋標籤 *vVER*。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: docs/zfr.adoc:108
#, no-wrap
msgid "*rename*"
msgstr "*rename*"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:112
msgid ""
"In the current project directory, rewrite *zephyr* → *_PROJECT_NAME_* and, "
"for each given name, rewrite the template puff *some_puff1* → that name.  "
"Does not rewrite *zfr*."
msgstr ""
"在當前工程目錄中，把 *zephyr* 改寫為 *_PROJECT_NAME_*，並把模板 puff *some_puff1* "
"改寫為每個給定名稱。不改寫 *zfr*。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: docs/zfr.adoc:113
#, no-wrap
msgid "*add*"
msgstr "*add*"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:117
msgid ""
"Detect the project language and copy the template puff files into the "
"current project, renaming *some_puff1* to each given *_PUFF_NAME_*. Updates "
"Meson lists (or equivalent wiring) when possible."
msgstr ""
"檢測工程語言，把模板 puff 檔案複製到當前工程，並將 *some_puff1* 重新命名為每個給定的 *_PUFF_NAME_*。儘可能更新 "
"Meson 列表（或等價接線）。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: docs/zfr.adoc:118
#, no-wrap
msgid "*remove*"
msgstr "*remove*"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:121
msgid ""
"Remove files and Meson wiring for each given puff name from the current "
"project."
msgstr "從當前工程刪除每個給定 puff 名稱對應的檔案與 Meson 接線。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: docs/zfr.adoc:122
#, no-wrap
msgid "*detect*"
msgstr "*detect*"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:125
msgid ""
"Print the detected language for the current directory (walks parent "
"directories to find the project root)."
msgstr "列印當前目錄檢測到的語言（向上查詢工程根目錄）。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: docs/zfr.adoc:126
#, no-wrap
msgid "*about*"
msgstr "*about*"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:136
msgid ""
"Print information about the current project. Walks from the current "
"directory toward parents to find the project root (*meson.build* with "
"*project()* or *debian/control*). Common fields (name, version, license, "
"homepage, maintainer, summary, section, priority, distribution, "
"architecture) are parsed from Debian or RPM metadata and wrapped to the "
"terminal width. Also prints source file/line counts and an estimated payload"
" size. Interactive terminals use CSR (console SGR) colors unless *NO_COLOR* "
"is set. Use *-d* / *-r* for a full parsed Debian or RPM view (not a dump of "
"the packaging files)."
msgstr ""
"列印當前工程資訊。從當前目錄向上查詢工程根（含 *project()* 的 *meson.build* 或 "
"*debian/control*）。常見欄位（名稱、版本、許可證、主頁、維護者、摘要、section、priority、發行版、架構）從 Debian "
"或 RPM 元資料解析，並按終端寬度換行。同時列印原始檔/行數與估算載荷大小。互動式終端使用 CSR（控制檯 SGR）著色，除非設定了 "
"*NO_COLOR*。用 *-d* / *-r* 檢視完整解析的 Debian 或 RPM 檢視（不是打包檔案的原文轉儲）。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: docs/zfr.adoc:137
#, no-wrap
msgid "*version*"
msgstr "*version*"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:142
msgid ""
"Print the current project version (one line, for scripts). Default is *git "
"describe* when *git* and *.git* are available, otherwise the latest "
"*debian/changelog* version. Falls back to a *VERSION* file, then *0.0.0*.  A"
" non-semver token (for example a git hash) is wrapped as *0.0.0-<token>*."
msgstr ""
"列印當前工程版本（一行，供指令碼使用）。若有 *git* 與 *.git*，預設用 *git describe*，否則用最新 "
"*debian/changelog* 版本。再回退到 *VERSION* 檔案，然後是 *0.0.0*。非 semver 記號（例如 git "
"雜湊）會包成 *0.0.0-<token>*。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: docs/zfr.adoc:143
#, no-wrap
msgid "*lint*"
msgstr "*lint*"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:156
msgid ""
"Validate the current project against zephyr packaging and layout style "
"(walks from the current directory toward parents to find the project root)."
"  Reports missing files, identity mismatches, Meson/Debian/RPM mistakes, "
"leftover *zephyr* / *some_puff1* tokens in instantiated apps, and suggested "
"fixes. Mentions of *zfr* are expected and are not treated as leftovers.  For"
" *.githooks/pre-commit*, walks up to *.git*, honors *core.hooksPath*, and "
"checks that the hook syncs *VERSION* from *debian/changelog*.  When *po/* is"
" present, warns if *LINGUAS* does not cover the recommended gettext locale "
"set (see *i18n* under Description).  Output is meant for humans and AI "
"coders: each finding has a code, path, and a concrete fix. Interactive "
"terminals use CSR (console SGR)  colors unless *NO_COLOR* is set."
msgstr ""
"按 zephyr 打包與佈局風格檢查當前工程（從當前目錄向上查詢工程根）。報告缺檔案、標識不一致、Meson/Debian/RPM "
"問題、例項化應用中殘留的 *zephyr* / *some_puff1* 標記，以及修改建議。出現 *zfr* 是預期行為，不視為殘留。對於 "
"*.githooks/pre-commit*，向上找到 *.git*，遵循 *core.hooksPath*，並檢查該鉤子是否從 "
"*debian/changelog* 同步 *VERSION*。若存在 *po/*，而 *LINGUAS* 未覆蓋推薦 gettext "
"語言集，則發出警告（見描述中的 *i18n*）。輸出面向人類與 AI 編碼助手：每條發現都有程式碼、路徑和具體修復。互動式終端使用 CSR（控制檯 "
"SGR）著色，除非設定了 *NO_COLOR*。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: docs/zfr.adoc:157
#, no-wrap
msgid "*shape*"
msgstr "*shape*"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:164
msgid ""
"Print a 0–100 *zephyr shape* score for the current *packagedir* (how "
"completely the tree matches zephyr packaging style). In a monorepo the "
"*packagedir* may differ from the *repodir* (git / meta root); tools use "
"shape to prefer the package directory over the repository root.  *\\-b* / "
"*--bool* prints *1* if the score is at least the threshold (default *50*), "
"otherwise *0*."
msgstr ""
"列印當前 *packagedir* 的 0–100 *zephyr shape* 分數（目錄與 zephyr 打包風格的吻合程度）。在單體倉中 "
"*packagedir* 可能不同於 *repodir*（git / 元倉庫根）；工具用 shape 優先選擇軟體包目錄而非倉庫根。*\\-b* / "
"*--bool* 在分數不低於閾值（預設 *50*）時列印 *1*，否則列印 *0*。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: docs/zfr.adoc:165
#, no-wrap
msgid "*dist*"
msgstr "*dist*"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:174
msgid ""
"Build a source archive of the current project (walks from the current "
"directory toward parents to find the project root). When this directory is "
"the git project root, run *meson dist* (after *meson setup*, default "
"*--allow-dirty* and *--no-tests*). Nested language templates have no *.git* "
"of their own, so *meson dist* would pack the parent meta-repo; those trees "
"get a directory tarball of this project only. Prints the archive path on "
"stdout. *rpm/Makefile* *dist* and the Meson *srcdist* ninja target reuse "
"this command."
msgstr ""
"為當前工程構建原始碼歸檔（從當前目錄向上查詢工程根）。若本目錄就是 git 工程根，則執行 *meson dist*（先 *meson "
"setup*，預設 *--allow-dirty* 與 *--no-tests*）。巢狀的語言模板沒有自己的 *.git*，*meson dist* "
"會打包上層元倉庫；這些樹只打包當前工程目錄。在標準輸出列印歸檔路徑。*rpm/Makefile* 的 *dist* 與 Meson 的 "
"*srcdist* ninja 目標複用此命令。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: docs/zfr.adoc:175
#, no-wrap
msgid "*ize*"
msgstr "*ize*"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:187
msgid ""
"Refactor the current project in place so it matches current zephyr style "
"(walks from the current directory toward parents). Copies missing *debian/* "
"and *rpm/* scaffolding from the language template (names rewritten to this "
"project), writes *VERSION* and *.githooks/pre-commit*, patches *meson.build*"
" (*zfr version*, *asciidoctor* man targets, *run_target look*, bash-"
"completion install). Converts groff *\\*.1* man pages under the project (not"
" *debian/*) into *docs/\\*.adoc* with Meson rules, and turns hardcoded "
"changelog versions in *src/* into *\\*.in* *@VERSION@* substitutions or "
"*PROJECT_VERSION* via *config.h* for C family languages. *\\-n* / *--dry-"
"run* prints the plan without writing.  Afterward run *zfr lint*."
msgstr ""
"就地重構當前工程以符合現行 zephyr 風格（從當前目錄向上查詢）。從語言模板複製缺失的 *debian/* 與 *rpm/* "
"腳手架（名稱改寫為本工程），寫入 *VERSION* 與 *.githooks/pre-commit*，修補 *meson.build*（*zfr "
"version*、*asciidoctor* 手冊目標、*run_target look*、bash 補全安裝）。把工程內（不含 *debian/*）的"
" groff *\\*.1* 手冊轉成帶 Meson 規則的 *docs/\\*.adoc*，並把 *src/* 中寫死的changelog 版本改成 "
"*\\*.in* 的 *@VERSION@* 替換，或 C 族語言透過 *config.h* 使用 *PROJECT_VERSION*。*\\-n* /"
" *--dry-run* 只打印計劃不寫入。完成後執行 *zfr lint*。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: docs/zfr.adoc:188
#, no-wrap
msgid "*help*"
msgstr "*help*"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:190
msgid "Show command-line help."
msgstr "顯示命令列幫助。"

#. type: Title ==
#: docs/zfr.adoc:191
#, no-wrap
msgid "Options"
msgstr "選項"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:194
msgid "Options for *create*:"
msgstr "*create* 的選項："

#. type: Labeled list
#: docs/zfr.adoc:195 docs/zfr.adoc:293
#, no-wrap
msgid "*-l, --lang* _LANG_"
msgstr "*-l, --lang* _LANG_"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:200
msgid ""
"Language template to use (default: *python*).  Supported values include "
"*bash*, *c*, *clib*, *cpp*, *cpplib*, *csharp*, *erlang*, *go*, *haskell*, "
"*java*, *perl*, *python*, *ruby*, *rust*, *smalltalk*, *swift*, and "
"*typescript*."
msgstr ""
"使用的語言模板（預設：*python*）。支援 "
"*bash*、*c*、*clib*、*cpp*、*cpplib*、*csharp*、*erlang*、*go*、*haskell*、*java*、*perl*、*python*、*ruby*、*rust*、*smalltalk*、*swift*"
" 和 *typescript*。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: docs/zfr.adoc:201
#, no-wrap
msgid "*-D, --distribution* _DIST_"
msgstr "*-D, --distribution* _DIST_"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:203
msgid "Debian changelog distribution (default: *unstable*)."
msgstr "Debian changelog 發行版（預設：*unstable*）。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: docs/zfr.adoc:204
#, no-wrap
msgid "*-1, --init-version* _VER_"
msgstr "*-1, --init-version* _VER_"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:206
msgid "Initial package version and git tag (default: *0.0.1*)."
msgstr "初始軟體包版本與 git 標籤（預設：*0.0.1*）。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: docs/zfr.adoc:207
#, no-wrap
msgid "*-a, --author* _AUTHOR_"
msgstr "*-a, --author* _AUTHOR_"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:209
msgid "Changelog and git author name (default: *Lenik (謝繼雷)*)."
msgstr "changelog 與 git 作者名（預設：*Lenik (謝繼雷)*）。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: docs/zfr.adoc:210
#, no-wrap
msgid "*-e, --email* _EMAIL_"
msgstr "*-e, --email* _EMAIL_"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:212
msgid "Changelog and git author email (default: *lenik@bodz.net*)."
msgstr "changelog 與 git 作者郵箱（預設：*lenik@bodz.net*）。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:214
msgid "Options for *about*:"
msgstr "*about* 的選項："

#. type: Labeled list
#: docs/zfr.adoc:215
#, no-wrap
msgid "*-d, --debian*"
msgstr "*-d, --debian*"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:219
msgid ""
"Show parsed Debian packaging fields (*debian/control*, latest "
"*debian/changelog* stanza). Lists such as *Build-Depends* are wrapped to the"
" terminal width; the long description is reflowed as paragraphs."
msgstr ""
"顯示解析後的 Debian 打包欄位（*debian/control*、最新 *debian/changelog* 段落）。*Build-"
"Depends* 等列表按終端寬度換行；長描述按段落重排。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: docs/zfr.adoc:220
#, no-wrap
msgid "*-r, --redhat*"
msgstr "*-r, --redhat*"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:224
msgid ""
"Show parsed RPM packaging fields from *rpm/*.spec* (macros like *%{version}*"
" are shown using *zfr version -r*). The *%description* body is reflowed; "
"spec scriptlets are not dumped."
msgstr ""
"顯示從 *rpm/*.spec* 解析的 RPM 打包欄位（*%{version}* 等宏用 *zfr version -r* "
"展開）。*%description* 正文會重排；spec 指令碼段不轉儲。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: docs/zfr.adoc:225 docs/zfr.adoc:253 docs/zfr.adoc:308
#, no-wrap
msgid "*--color* _WHEN_"
msgstr "*--color* _WHEN_"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:228 docs/zfr.adoc:256 docs/zfr.adoc:311
msgid ""
"CSR highlighting: *auto* (default: TTY and no *NO_COLOR*), *always*, or "
"*never*."
msgstr "CSR 著色：*auto*（預設：TTY 且未設定 *NO_COLOR*）、*always* 或 *never*。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:230
msgid "Options for *version*:"
msgstr "*version* 的選項："

#. type: Labeled list
#: docs/zfr.adoc:231
#, no-wrap
msgid "*-g, --git*"
msgstr "*-g, --git*"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:234
msgid ""
"Use *git describe --tags --always --dirty* (default when *git* and *.git* "
"are available)."
msgstr "使用 *git describe --tags --always --dirty*（有 *git* 與 *.git* 時的預設）。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: docs/zfr.adoc:235
#, no-wrap
msgid "*-c, --changelog*"
msgstr "*-c, --changelog*"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:238
msgid ""
"Use the latest *debian/changelog* version (default when *git* or *.git* is "
"unavailable)."
msgstr "使用最新 *debian/changelog* 版本（無 *git* 或 *.git* 時的預設）。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: docs/zfr.adoc:239
#, no-wrap
msgid "*-r, --rpm*"
msgstr "*-r, --rpm*"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:241
msgid "Print an RPM-compatible *Version* (hyphens mapped to underscores)."
msgstr "列印 RPM 相容的 *Version*（連字元對映為下劃線）。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:243
msgid "Options for *lint*:"
msgstr "*lint* 的選項："

#. type: Labeled list
#: docs/zfr.adoc:244 docs/zfr.adoc:262 docs/zfr.adoc:299
#, no-wrap
msgid "*-v, --verbose*"
msgstr "*-v, --verbose*"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:246
msgid "Also print passing checks."
msgstr "同時列印透過的檢查項。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: docs/zfr.adoc:247
#, no-wrap
msgid "*-q, --quiet*"
msgstr "*-q, --quiet*"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:249
msgid "Only print errors."
msgstr "只打印錯誤。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: docs/zfr.adoc:250
#, no-wrap
msgid "*--strict*"
msgstr "*--strict*"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:252
msgid "Treat warnings as failures (exit status 1)."
msgstr "把警告當作失敗（退出狀態 1）。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:258
msgid "Options for *shape*:"
msgstr "*shape* 的選項："

#. type: Labeled list
#: docs/zfr.adoc:259
#, no-wrap
msgid "*-b, --bool*"
msgstr "*-b, --bool*"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:261
msgid "Print *1* if the shape score is at least *--threshold*, otherwise *0*."
msgstr "若 shape 分數不低於 *--threshold* 則列印 *1*，否則列印 *0*。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:264
msgid ""
"Print *packagedir*, *repodir*, *role*, and *threshold* on standard error."
msgstr "在標準錯誤列印 *packagedir*、*repodir*、*role* 和 *threshold*。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: docs/zfr.adoc:265
#, no-wrap
msgid "*--threshold* _N_"
msgstr "*--threshold* _N_"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:267
msgid "Threshold for *--bool* (default: *50*)."
msgstr "*--bool* 的閾值（預設：*50*）。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:269
msgid "Options for *dist*:"
msgstr "*dist* 的選項："

#. type: Labeled list
#: docs/zfr.adoc:270
#, no-wrap
msgid "*-o, --output* _DIR_"
msgstr "*-o, --output* _DIR_"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:273
msgid ""
"Write the archive into *_DIR_* (default: the Meson *meson-dist* directory, "
"or *rpmbuild/SOURCES* with *--rpm*)."
msgstr ""
"把歸檔寫入 *_DIR_*（預設：Meson 的 *meson-dist* 目錄；加 *--rpm* 時為 *rpmbuild/SOURCES*）。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: docs/zfr.adoc:274
#, no-wrap
msgid "*-b, --builddir* _DIR_"
msgstr "*-b, --builddir* _DIR_"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:277
msgid ""
"Meson build directory. Default is */build* when that builddir was configured"
" for this source tree, otherwise *<project>/build*."
msgstr "Meson 構建目錄。若 */build* 是為本原始碼樹配置的則用它，否則用 *<project>/build*。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: docs/zfr.adoc:278
#, no-wrap
msgid "*-f, --format* _FMT_"
msgstr "*-f, --format* _FMT_"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:280
msgid "Archive format: *xz* (default), *gz*, or *zip*."
msgstr "歸檔格式：*xz*（預設）、*gz* 或 *zip*。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: docs/zfr.adoc:281
#, no-wrap
msgid "*--rpm*"
msgstr "*--rpm*"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:284
msgid ""
"Name the archive *_NAME_*-*_VERSION_*.tar.xz and write it to "
"*rpmbuild/SOURCES* unless *-o* is given. Used by *rpm/Makefile*."
msgstr ""
"將歸檔命名為 *_NAME_*-*_VERSION_*.tar.xz，並寫入 *rpmbuild/SOURCES*（除非給出 *-o*）。供 "
"*rpm/Makefile* 使用。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: docs/zfr.adoc:285
#, no-wrap
msgid "*--allow-dirty*, *--no-allow-dirty*"
msgstr "*--allow-dirty*, *--no-allow-dirty*"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:287
msgid "Pass *--allow-dirty* to *meson dist* (default: allow)."
msgstr "向 *meson dist* 傳遞 *--allow-dirty*（預設允許）。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: docs/zfr.adoc:288
#, no-wrap
msgid "*--tests*"
msgstr "*--tests*"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:290
msgid "Run tests during *meson dist* (default is *--no-tests*)."
msgstr "在 *meson dist* 期間執行測試（預設 *--no-tests*）。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:292
msgid "Options for *ize*:"
msgstr "*ize* 的選項："

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:295
msgid "Language template to copy scaffolding from (default: detect)."
msgstr "用於複製腳手架的語言模板（預設：自動檢測）。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: docs/zfr.adoc:296
#, no-wrap
msgid "*-n, --dry-run*"
msgstr "*-n, --dry-run*"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:298
msgid "Print planned adds/updates/conversions without writing files."
msgstr "列印計劃的新增/更新/轉換，不寫入檔案。"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:301
msgid "Also print skipped paths that are already present."
msgstr "同時列印已經存在因而跳過的路徑。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: docs/zfr.adoc:302
#, no-wrap
msgid "*--no-man*"
msgstr "*--no-man*"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:304
msgid "Do not convert groff *\\*.1* sources to *docs/\\*.adoc*."
msgstr "不要把 groff *\\*.1* 原始檔轉換成 *docs/\\*.adoc*。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: docs/zfr.adoc:305
#, no-wrap
msgid "*--no-subst*"
msgstr "*--no-subst*"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:307
msgid ""
"Do not rewrite hardcoded versions in *src/* to *@VERSION@* / *config.h*."
msgstr "不要把 *src/* 中寫死的版本改寫成 *@VERSION@* / *config.h*。"

#. type: Title ==
#: docs/zfr.adoc:312
#, no-wrap
msgid "Environment"
msgstr "環境變數"

#. type: Labeled list
#: docs/zfr.adoc:314
#, no-wrap
msgid "*ZFR_PKGDATADIR*"
msgstr "*ZFR_PKGDATADIR*"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:316
msgid "Override the templates root (normally */usr/share/zephyr*)."
msgstr "覆蓋模板根目錄（通常為 */usr/share/zephyr*）。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: docs/zfr.adoc:317
#, no-wrap
msgid "*NO_COLOR*"
msgstr "*NO_COLOR*"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:320
msgid ""
"When set, *zfr about*, *zfr lint*, and *zfr ize* disable CSR highlighting in"
" *--color auto* mode."
msgstr "設定後，*zfr about*、*zfr lint* 和 *zfr ize* 在 *--color auto* 模式下停用 CSR 著色。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: docs/zfr.adoc:321
#, no-wrap
msgid "*PYTHONPATH*"
msgstr "*PYTHONPATH*"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:324
msgid ""
"Must include the directory that contains the *zfr_lib* package when running "
"the tools from a non-default install layout."
msgstr "以非預設安裝佈局執行工具時，必須包含 *zfr_lib* 所在目錄。"

#. type: Title ==
#: docs/zfr.adoc:325
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tests"
msgstr "測試"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:334
msgid ""
"The source tree (not the installed package) includes *tests/* with Python "
"*unittest* coverage of the CLI. *meson test* (build directory */build*) "
"discovers *tests/test_\\*.py*. Tests create temporary example projects and "
"exercise *create*, *add*, *remove*, *rename*, *about*, *version*, *lint*, "
"*dist*, *ize*, and *detect*. When running without Meson, set "
"*ZFR_PKGDATADIR* to the zephyr checkout root (parent of *zfr/*) and "
"*PYTHONPATH* to *src/*."
msgstr ""
"原始碼樹（非已安裝軟體包）包含 *tests/*，用 Python *unittest* 覆蓋 CLI。*meson test*（構建目錄 "
"*/build*）發現 *tests/test_\\*.py*。測試會建立臨時示例工程並行使 "
"*create*、*add*、*remove*、*rename*、*about*、*version*、*lint*、*dist*、*ize* 和 "
"*detect*。不經 Meson 執行時，把 *ZFR_PKGDATADIR* 設為 zephyr 檢出根（*zfr/* 的上一級），把 "
"*PYTHONPATH* 設為 *src/*。"

