"Success. For *lint*, the project has no error-level findings (warnings still"
" print unless *--strict*)."
msgstr "成功。對 *lint* 而言，工程沒有錯誤級發現（警告仍會列印，除非 *--strict*）。"

#. type: Labeled list
#: docs/zfr.adoc:355
#, no-wrap
msgid "*non-zero*"
msgstr "*non-zero*"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/zfr.adoc:358
